      </div>
      <div class="site-footer__col">
        <h3 class="site-footer__col-title">工坊</h3>
        <ul class="site-footer__links">
          <li><a href="/workshop/">乐乐工坊</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#office">AI办公</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#driving">自动驾驶</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#embodied">具身智能</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#digital-twin">数字孪生</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#learning">教育学习</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#career">职场求职</a></li>
          <li><a href="/workshop/#marketing">市场营销</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="site-footer__col">
        <h3 class="site-footer__col-title">了解更多</h3>
        <ul class="site-footer__links">
          <li><a href="/#thinking">万物闭环</a></li>
          <li><a href="/articles/">闭环思维</a></li>
          <li><a href="/">关于 NeuraVoxel</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="site-footer__col">
        <h3 class="site-footer__col-title">联系我们</h3>
        <ul class="site-footer__links">
          <li><a href="/contact/">合作咨询</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:contact@neuravoxel.cn">contact@neuravoxel.cn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://neuravoxel.cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">neuravoxel.cn</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="site-footer__bar">
    <div class="site-footer__bar-left">
      <span>© 2026 NeuraVoxel · neuravoxel.cn</span>
      <span class="site-footer__philosophy">万物闭环 · 从小做起</span>
    </div>
    <div class="site-footer__bar-right">
      <a href="#">隐私政策</a>
